# DiarizationLM-8b-Fisher-v2, Q4_K_M -- the purpose-trained speaker-label corrector.
# TEMPLATE is a RAW PASSTHROUGH on purpose: this is a completion-style finetune on base
# Llama-3 (the card's usage tokenizes the bare hypothesis + " --> " with no chat template);
# Ollama's default llama3 chat wrapper would bury the prompt in headers the finetune has
# never seen. Stop at [eod], its trained end-of-diarization marker -- the card's own example
# shows it rambling "[eod] [eod] <speaker:1" past the first one otherwise. num_ctx 4096
# matches the training max sequence length (prompt cap is 6000 chars incl. " --> ").
FROM ./DiarizationLM-8b-Fisher-v2.Q4_K_M.gguf
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER stop [eod]
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
